			},
			"date": "2022-03-28T13:54:22.000Z",
			"content": "I’m going to use GA groupings. I believe I need do a loop filter to search for post.title so I can theme the results? Set to a @ weekly cron Do this for each collection + home page. Next will be indieweb stats. 🧮\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://adactio.com/journal/6667/\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
